  "description": "Inflate your designs with glossy fun, soft rounded volume, and vibrant playful charm using Geranium! Designed as a premium bubble display font, each character features plush liquid curves and crisp inner highlight reflections that mimic shiny 3D jelly or balloon letters. Its friendly, eye-catching silhouette adds instant warmth and cheerful personality to modern craft projects and digital layouts.\nIdeal for children’s apparel, birthday party banners, summer celebration graphics, sticker pack designs, quote art prints, product packaging, YouTube thumbnails, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
